        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents I08-P7550-605 5 House Number Address Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3-3/4\" high polished brass numbers really stand out against the black plate background color making this Five Number Address Plate easy to read. The black on gold color scheme gives the sense of old world America, and all the glamour and glitz of 1920's decor.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <b>Five (5) Numbers</b>. The entire address number assembly including the frame is made of solid brass. Packaged with mounting screws and anchors for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/three-number-polished-brass-address-plate-assembly-brass-accents-i08-p7530-605\"><b>3 Number Address Plate</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/polished-brass-four-number-address-plate-assembly-brass-accents-i08-p7540-605\"><b>4 Number Address Plate</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/5-house-address-plate-example.jpg?v=1704442267\" width=\"430\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents 5 House Number Address Plate Example\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents I08-P7550-605 5 House Number Address Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 16-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Number Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with 5 numbers, frame, back plate and mounting screws for easy installation. Assembled and Finished in the USA. Usually ships in one week.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBelow select your 5 address numbers in the order required. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Five Number Address Plate, Brass Accents I08-P7550-605",
                "description": "Brass Accents I08-P7550-605 Polished Brass House Numbers. For use with Five (5) Numbers. The entire address number assembly including the frame is made of solid brass. Packaged with mounting screws and anchors for easy installation. Finally a easy to read address marker plate assembly for your office or house. The 3-3/4 inch high polished brass numbers really stand out against the black plate background color.",
